dasDOOM
=======

dasDOOM is the doomgeneric Doom engine translated from C to daslang.

- Original work: doomgeneric, https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric, revision
  @UPSTREAM_COMMIT@, licensed under the GNU General Public License,
  version 2 (see LICENSE). doomgeneric is based on Chocolate Doom and on the
  Doom source code released by id Software.
- Translation: generated by c2das, https://github.com/lookibed/c2das, at commit
  @C2DAS_COMMIT@ (scripts/export_dasdoom.py).
- The c2das-authored harness files, the C sources in harness/ (engine_config.h,
  all.c, doom_entry.c, dg_platform.c, doom_eden_play_all.c, dg_eden_play.c,
  dg_eden_sound.c, eden_play_include/SDL_mixer.h), their translations, and the
  hand-written EdenSpark host eden/c2das_doom_player.das are part of this GPL
  work and are distributed under the same licence.

The Doom shareware IWAD (doom1.wad) is not included; tools/get_wad.sh downloads it.
